<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets &quot;New Nifty Fifty' warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets &quot;New Nifty Fifty' warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) has issued four million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Morgan Stanley Multinational Index (New Nifty Fifty), lead manager Morgn Stanley &amp; Co. International Ltd said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  395.80</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>	    STRIKE	PRICE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     395	   $54.17     13.48 PCT   7.31 X</p>
<p> CALL     415	   $44.55     16.11 PCT   8.88 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
